OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Fgenerally cloudy into the evening.
OL,7,FIsolated clearer spells may develop
OL,8,Fovernight but these will be short-
OL,9,Flived. The wind eases but still
OL,10,Ffeeling relatively cool.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FA generally cloudy day.
OL,13,FBrighter spells possible through the
OL,14,Fmorning and remaining dry for most.
OL,15,FCloud thickens later with outbreaks of
OL,16,Flight rain. Near average temperatures
OL,17,Fwith light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
