OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FHigh
OL,6,Fpressure continues to dominate, often
OL,7,Fbringing cloudy conditions with light
OL,8,Frain at times but some clearer spells
OL,9,Ftoo. Gentle breeze. Temperatures
OL,10,Fremain around normal for the time of
OL,11,Fyear.
